# Line endings and file types.
#
# .editorconfig asks editors for LF; this asks git for the same, so a checkout on
# Windows can't quietly turn a plugin file into CRLF and hand a store a file that
# differs byte for byte from the one that was tested.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
